1) Use a magic whistle to teleport the pet near you
2) Use a non-magic whistle to cause the pet to move toward you for a
few turns
3) Keep a tripe ration in main inventory (not in a bag/sack) to cause
the pet to try to stick near you
4) Displace the pet so that it's in front of you in corridors and the
like, and let it run ahead of you
5) When a monster's around, keep the pet between you and the monster
(keep moving behind it on your turn)
6) How tough a monster is doesn't matter to how much it helps the pet
level up, so definitely let the pet kill the weaklings
7) As a healer, use your stethoscope freely and heal the pet when it's
injured


